CT_BRASS_3_REST → CIRCUS_REST_2_4 { ↓1=↑; ⇑=⇓1; }
@withoutSpaces
CT_BRASS_4_DOMINANT → BAR2
{ ↓1=↑ ∪ [motif:[o1:11,o2:7], rhythm:[r1:"1/4",r2:"1/4"]]; ⇑=⇓1; }
@withoutSpaces
CT_BRASS_5_SUBDOM → BAR2
